{
  "what_this_is": "Trillion's defaults: the rules and schedules every Trillion account has by itself, read by src/starting-rules.mjs, each shown on the Automations screen as made by Trillion with its own switch, words to edit, Run now and Delete. `every_account` rows are every account's, read from the deploy and never copied into anyone's store (src/shipped-defaults.mjs), so a row changed here reaches every account that never touched it with nothing written: a row with schedule_id is a schedule (the shape set_schedule takes), any other row is a rule (the shape set_rule takes). What a default runs is a Workshop tool or workflow; Trillion's own behaviors are tools on placement:this-account (records/workshop-account-tool-records.json). `each_connected_event` is the one shape used for every event a connected account can send: for each connection, every event source whose connects_with.vendor is that connection's vendor (records/workshop-event-source-records.json) brings one rule per event it declares, read the same way, and Trillion starts listening. A new service is an event source row, never a row here or code. A person's store keeps only their changes: a default they turned off stays off, one they edited keeps their words, and one they removed stays removed; put back, it is Trillion's current version again. A default that hands work to an AI names the item it is about in `once_per` (an arrival's message, an asked record's id), so however many rules or runs hand one item, it is one handoff. A rule row may list in `earlier_then` the `then` Trillion set before its current words: an account that kept a copy from before the defaults shipped, still on, under the row's label and holding one of those, never touched it, so the copy is let go (src/starting-rules.mjs keptAsChanges). Every default names in `backs` the settings it stands behind, as [{ screen, item }]: a screen's surface id (src/workspace/surfaces.json) and the id of the item on it, so each screen finds the automations behind its settings by reading that field.",
  "listen_retry": {
    "first_after_seconds": 60,
    "factor": 2,
    "longest_after_seconds": 900
  },
  "every_account": [
    {
      "rule_id": "starting:board-for-each-decided-build",
      "enabled": false,
      "label": "Give each thing you decide to build its own board",
      "backs": [
        {
          "screen": "trillion.pursuits",
          "item": "boards"
        }
      ],
      "when": {
        "recorded": "decision",
        "where": [
          {
            "field": "status",
            "equals": "needs_outcome"
          },
          {
            "field": "method.id",
            "equals": "universal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "tool_id": "tool:keep-a-board",
        "input": {
          "subject": {
            "fill": {
              "from": "record",
              "field": "id"
            }
          },
          "title": {
            "fill": {
              "from": "record",
              "field": "input.goal"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
